    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaala yaEzira eyobwiyami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho amakhuwa aka kosi olwa kali nikahweele, abakhulundu banzitsila nibasunga bari Abandu baIsiraeli nabakuhani nabaLawi shibeeyahukhasiye khumbia etsiomubialo bino nebisinyo biabwe, mbu abaKanaani, abaHiti, abaPerizi abaYebusi, abaAmoni, abaMoabu, abaMisiri nabaAmori ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba baleerile abokhubakhaana babwe, khulwabwe abeene nokhulwa abaana babwe; mana abolwibulo olutakatifu nibatsokaana mubetsimbia tsiebialo; ne nitoto, mbu mubukhayi buno amakhono kabakhulundu naboburuchi niko akaranjilila mubwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa ndahulila likhuwa elo, ndarandula eshiifwalo shianje neingubo yanje ifuubila, ninzihakhwo liswi lianje neshilefu, ninzikhala ning'ang'aala butswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abo bosi abatechelela amakhuwa kaNyasaye walsiraeli, khulwa obukhayi bwa abo abobwarwi, nibakhung'aana ewanje; nasi ninzikhala ning'ang'aalile okhuula khusaa yeshihaanwa shiomungoloobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khusaa yeshihaanwa shiomungoloobe, nimbuukha nirula mukhuhonga inzala, eshiifwalo shianje neifuubila yanje nibiranduushe birio; nisikama amasikamo, nimukalishila OMWAMI Nyasaye wanje amakhono; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimboola mbu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Nyasaye wanje, endi netsisoni nifwimbwa omurwe okhukhuchinguulila tsimoni tsianje, Nyasaye wanje; okhuba obumayaanu bweefwe bwimeetile nibukhuyembeelela khumirwe, ebikha bieefwe bikhulile nibiula khwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhurula khundaalo tsiabakuuka beefwe, khubeetsanga nebikha ebinji, okhuula olwa leelo; ne khulwa obumayaanu bweefwe ifwe halala nabaruchi beefwe nabakuhani beefwe, khuhaanungwa mumakhono kabaruchi bebialo, nokhulukanga, nokhubwarwi, nokhukhuyaaywa, nokhusoni, shinga olwa kali olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, eshise eshituutu butswa, khukoosiibwe nOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe, nikhuleshelwa omusikalo okweehonokokha, nikhukhomwa shinga omusumari habunduwe ahatakatifu, mbu Nyasaye weefwe akhwamuusie tsimoni, nakhulamusia hatuutu mubusumba bweefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khuli abasumbanebutswa Nyasaye weefwe shiakhuleshile mubusumba bweefwe ta, habula akhukholeele akobuheelibwe oburalilu mumoni tsiabaruchi baPerisia, okhukhulamusia, nokhusinjisia inzu yaNyasaye weefwe, nokhukasia amalikulukho kayo, nokhukhuheelesia olukoba muYuda nomuYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, Nyasaye weefwe, inyuma wa ako kosi, khuboole khurie? Okhuba khuleshile amalakoko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka walaka mubasumbabo abanabii, ori Eshialo eshia mwitsa okhwinjilamwo okhushibukula, neshialo eshili mwibilu khulwa obukaali bwetsimbia etsiomubialo, khulwa ebisinyo biabwe, ebishiitsusiye tu akeshifwabwi shiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rho bulaano murabakhanga abakhaana beenywe khubaana babwe, kata okhukhweesia abaana beenywe abakhaana babwe, kata okhukhaabanga akomulembe kwabwe kata okhurabaala khwabwe, nahatuutu tambu mubeetsenje abamaani nimulia khubilayi bieshialo, nimushileshela abaana beenywe shibe obulaame bwabwe ebisoni nebisoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa kano kosi kakhukwila khulwa ebikhole bieefwe ebibii khandi khulwa ebikha bieefwe ebinji; nawe Nyasaye weefwe olwa orakhukuumile okhuhela akakwaniile obumayaanu bweefwe ta, ne nokhuheele omusikalo kurio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ifwe khuloonooninjia amalakoko khandi, nikhuteeshania nabetsimbia etsikholanga ebisinyo bino noho? Shiwakhakhutiililwa oburima okhuula olwa wakhaba nokhusishiye, nikuratong'akhwo omusikalo kwosi kata abeehonokooshe ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, niwe omulunjishi; okhuba khutong'ile omusikalo butswa okweehonokokha, shinga olwa kali leelo; lola, khuli imbeliwo nende obwonooneshi bweefwe; okhuba abulaho ounyala okhusinjila imbeliwo, khulwa amakhuwa kano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
